    m_Localized: "Press a key or mouse button. Escape cancels. Keys 1\u20138 switch
      weapon groups."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1051721908
    m_Localized: Also used by {0}. Both groups will fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1051721909
    m_Localized: This input is reserved for flight, menus, or weapon group toggles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
